// Signing identity for every target. project.yml, both .entitlements files
// and the Info.plists read these; nothing else should spell the IDs out.
//
// To sign under your own team, copy Local.xcconfig.example to Local.xcconfig
// (gitignored) and override what you need. It survives `xcodegen generate`,
// unlike edits made in Xcode's Signing tab.
//
// Rules the overrides must keep:
// - every target's bundle ID starts with AMGI_BUNDLE_ID (iOS rejects an
//   embedded widget whose ID is not prefixed by its app's);
// - AMGI_APP_GROUP is registered to the team that signs the build.

AMGI_BUNDLE_ID = com.amgiapp.AmgiApp
AMGI_APP_GROUP = group.com.amgiapp

#include? "Local.xcconfig"
